<h1>08_社会关系、文化习俗与道德伦理 (Society, Culture, Kinship & Ethics)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>199</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_社会阶层、声望地位与群体归属 (115)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_人际交往、友谊敌意与默契羁绊 (50)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_道德伦理、美德善恶与良知操守 (26)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_传统习俗、礼仪禁忌与宗教信仰 (8)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_社会阶层、声望地位与群体归属 (Social Status, Prestige, Class & Lineage)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 115 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>priority</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la priorité<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 priority</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/prai'ɒriti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pʁijɔʁite/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('priority', 'la priorité')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 优先权, 优先</td><td class='def-en'>status established in order of importance or urgency</td><td>4.41</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“...its precedence as the world's leading manufacturer of pharmaceuticals”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>precedence</span><span class='syn-tag'>precedency</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> high status</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>elite</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'élite<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 elite</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ei'li:t/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/elit/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('elite', 'l\'élite')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 精华, 精锐, 中坚分子</td><td class='def-en'>a group or class of persons enjoying superior intellectual or social or economic status</td><td>4.4</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of elite (a group or class of persons enjoying superior intellectual or social or economic status).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>elite group</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> upper class</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>honour</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'honneur<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 honour</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɒnә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɔnœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('honour', 'l\'honneur')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 荣誉, 头衔, 信用, 尊敬, 名誉, 阁下, 勋章</td><td class='def-en'>the state of being honored</td><td>4.37</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of honour (the state of being honored).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>honor</span><span class='syn-tag'>laurels</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> standing</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>glory</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la gloire<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 glory</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'glɒ:ri/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/glwaʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('glory', 'la gloire')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 光荣, 荣耀, 荣誉, 壮丽, 繁荣</td><td class='def-en'>a state of high honor</td><td>4.36</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“he valued glory above life itself”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>glorification</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> honor</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>fame</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la gloire<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 fame</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/feim/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/glwaʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('fame', 'la gloire')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 名望, 名声, 传说</td><td class='def-en'>the state or quality of being widely honored and acclaimed</td><td>4.34</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of fame (the state or quality of being widely honored and acclaimed).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>celebrity</span><span class='syn-tag'>renown</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> honor</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>emphasis</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'accent<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 emphasis</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'emfәsis/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/aksɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('emphasis', 'l\'accent')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 强调, 加强, 重点, 强语气</td><td class='def-en'>special importance or significance</td><td>4.19</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“the red light gave the central figure increased emphasis”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>accent</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> importance</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>ranking</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le classement<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 ranking</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ræŋkiŋ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/klasmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('ranking', 'le classement')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 等级, 地位</td><td class='def-en'>position on a scale in relation to others in a sport</td><td>4.19</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of ranking (position on a scale in relation to others in a sport).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> standing</div></div></td></tr>
